{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Western Death</i>, you navigate through rooms, slaying creatures, earning experience, and collecting new weapons. With each level-up, you can choose from various cards that grant unique perks and bonuses, enhancing your abilities and playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Western Death</i>, you play as Jack Wotson, a fearless bounty hunter on a mission to track down the notorious serial killer John Willams, a man with the power to wield magic. Your goal is to stop Willams before his dark sorcery brings ruin to the world.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome To The Wild West","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634880/4bb8b5f25efbbdd9bc682e2a193beac3534087ff.jpg"},{"name":"Jelly State","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634880/9a52e4ee17e7b3f4600e6dc0777ab8dcc023bba0.jpg"},{"name":"Army of jelly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634880/9a52e4ee17e7b3f4600e6dc0777ab8dcc023bba0.jpg"},{"name":"Devourer of Slimes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634880/9a52e4ee17e7b3f4600e6dc0777ab8dcc023bba0.jpg"},{"name":"The Slime Reaper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634880/9a52e4ee17e7b3f4600e6dc0777ab8dcc023bba0.jpg"},{"name":"Slime Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634880/9a52e4ee17e7b3f4600e6dc0777ab8dcc023bba0.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie Slime Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634880/9a52e4ee17e7b3f4600e6dc0777ab8dcc023bba0.jpg"},{"name":"Jelly Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634880/9a52e4ee17e7b3f4600e6dc0777ab8dcc023bba0.jpg"},{"name":"Eyes watching you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams